WEBVTT

NOTE
This is the SeeD graduation ceremony and celebration at Balamb Garden.
The scene establishes the festive atmosphere of the SeeD initiation ball.
Duration: approximately 22 seconds.

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Balamb Garden is illuminated brilliantly at night for a grand celebration. The circular structure glows with warm artificial lighting from countless windows and architectural lighting elements. The central tower is highlighted, creating a dramatic silhouette against the dark night sky. The entire facility is transformed into a glowing beacon of celebration, a stark contrast to the military focus of daytime operations.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
Fireworks burst explosively in the sky above Balamb Garden. Brilliant colors — reds, blues, greens, and golds — illuminate the night sky in spectacular bursts. Multiple fireworks detonate simultaneously, creating a dazzling display of light and color. The explosions reflect off surfaces around the Garden, creating shimmering effects. The celebration is grand and joyous, marking the successful completion of the SeeD Field Exam and the inauguration of new members into the elite SeeD force.

00:12.000 --> 00:18.000
Inside the Garden, students gather in formal attire within the elegant ballroom. The room is large and spacious with high ceilings and polished floors. Chandeliers cast warm, golden light throughout the space. Garden cadets wear dress uniforms, formal suits, and elegant gowns. Small groups of people stand together, conversing and celebrating. The atmosphere is festive yet refined, befitting a military academy's formal ceremony.

00:18.000 --> 00:22.000
The camera captures the full scope of the ballroom celebration. The grand space is filled with celebrating cadets and instructors. The architecture of the ballroom reflects the Garden's modern, futuristic design. The bright interior lighting creates a warm, celebratory ambiance. This establishing shot sets the tone for the upcoming events of the graduation ball.
